<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: SOCCER-GUATEMALA-TRINIDAD/TOBAGO DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GUATEMALA-TRINIDAD/TOBAGO DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN, Trinidad 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guatemala and Trinidad and Tobago played to a 1-1 draw in a CONCACAF World Cup qualifying game on Sunday.</p>
<p>Carlos Ramirez scored for Guatemala in the 24th minute, and Jerren Nixon got the equaliser for Trinidad and Tobago in the 39th minute.</p>
<p>A capacity crowd of 20,000 watched the game.</p>
</text>
